* ================================================
*  SCIENCE KNOWLEDGE QUIZ
* ================================================
*  An interactive educational quiz covering
*  Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Earth Science,
*  and Astronomy. 15 questions with detailed
*  explanations reinforce key science concepts.
*
*  Features: T: text output, A: input,
*  M: pattern matching, MT: conditional text,
*  U:/E: subroutine calls, R: runtime commands,
*  variable interpolation with {VAR} syntax.
* ================================================

T:
T:  ================================================
T:       SCIENCE KNOWLEDGE QUIZ
T:  ================================================
T:
T:  Welcome to the Science Knowledge Quiz!
T:
T:  You will answer 15 questions across five
T:  branches of science:
T:
T:    [1]  Physics        (Questions  1 - 3)
T:    [2]  Chemistry       (Questions  4 - 6)
T:    [3]  Biology         (Questions  7 - 9)
T:    [4]  Earth Science   (Questions 10 - 12)
T:    [5]  Astronomy       (Questions 13 - 15)
T:
T:  Type your best answer after each question.
T:  Abbreviations and common synonyms are
T:  accepted. Each question includes a detailed
T:  explanation so you learn as you go.
T:
T:  ================================================
T:
R:TIME
T:

